#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rechunk.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rechunk"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rechunk:1 of
msgid "Rechunk LiteFrame data."
msgstr "重新分块LiteFrame数据。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rechunk:3 of
msgid ""
"This function is used to reorganize the chunk structure of data, which "
"can change how data is distributed in distributed computing. By adjusting"
" chunk sizes, memory usage and computational performance can be "
"optimized. LiteFrame is only ever chunked along the row axis (axis 0); "
"the column axis always stays a single chunk. Note that this function is "
"only effective in DPE for now."
msgstr ""
"此函数用于重新组织数据的块结构，这可以改变数据在分布式计算中的分布方式。"
"通过调整块大小，可以优化内存使用和计算性能。LiteFrame仅沿行轴（轴0）进行"
"分块；列轴始终是单个块。请注意，此函数目前仅在DPE中有效。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rechunk of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rechunk:10 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"New chunk size configuration. Can be one of the following forms:  - "
"Integer: row chunk size, e.g. ``100`` rechunks rows into chunks of 100. -"
" Tuple: per-dimension sizes; only the first element (rows) takes   "
"effect. For instance, ``(100, 2)`` rechunks rows into chunks of 100. - "
"Dictionary: chunk sizes for specific dimensions, for instance,   ``{0: "
"100}`` rechunks dimension 0 into 100 rows per chunk, and   ``{0: (100, "
"100, 100)}`` rechunks dimension 0 into 3 chunks where   each chunk has "
"100 rows."
msgstr ""
"新的块大小配置。可以是以下形式之一： - 整数：行块大小，例如 ``100`` 将行"
"重新分块为每块100行。 - 元组：每个维度的大小；只有第一个元素（行）生效。"
"例如， ``(100, 2)`` 将行重新分块为每块100行。 - 字典：特定维度的块大小，"
"例如， ``{0: 100}`` 将维度0重新分块为每块100行，而 ``{0: (100, 100, 100)}"
"`` 将维度0重新分块为3个块，每个块有100行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rechunk:20 of
msgid "Reserved for future use."
msgstr "保留供将来使用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rechunk:22 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If specified, ``chunk_size`` applies only to that axis. Internally "
"normalized to the dict form ``{axis: chunk_size}``. Cannot be used "
"together with a dict ``chunk_size``."
msgstr ""
"如果指定，则 ``chunk_size`` 仅适用于该轴。在内部规范化为字典形式 ``{axis:"
" chunk_size}``。不能与字典 ``chunk_size`` 一起使用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rechunk of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rechunk:27 of
msgid "The rechunked LiteFrame object."
msgstr "重新分块的LiteFrame对象。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.rechunk.rechunk of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

